# Canonical identities for this repository.
#
# Git reads this file to collapse several name and address spellings onto one
# contributor in `git shortlog`, `git log --use-mailmap`, `git blame` and most
# forge interfaces. It changes DISPLAY ONLY. The raw commit objects still hold
# whatever name and address were used at commit time.
#
# Format, canonical first:
#   Canonical Name <canonical@email> Commit Name <commit@email>
#   Canonical Name <canonical@email> <commit@email>          # any name, that address
#   Canonical Name <canonical@email> Commit Name <>          # that name, any address
#
# To change how you are displayed everywhere, edit the canonical side of these
# lines. Keep AUTHORS in agreement.

